  "description": "Find a path from top-left to bottom-right of a grid which minimizes the sum of all numbers along its path.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. for i in 0..m-1: for j in 0..n-1:\n2.   if i==0 and j>0: grid[i][j] += grid[i][j-1]\n3.   else if i>0 and j==0: grid[i][j] += grid[i-1][j]\n4.   else if i>0 and j>0: grid[i][j] += min(grid[i-1][j], grid[i][j-1])\n5. return grid[m-1][n-1]",
